Het IRIW-cgcg-sys-relaxed
"Heterogeneous IRIW-cgcg-sys-relaxed: per-proc device assignment cpu,gpu,cpu,gpu (cpu=AArch64, gpu=LISA/PTX)"
{
0:X0=x;
0:X2=y;
2:X0=x;
2:X2=y;
}
 P0:cpu      | P1:gpu             | P2:cpu      | P3:gpu             ;
 LDR W1,[X0] | w[relaxed,sys] y 1 | LDR W1,[X2] | w[relaxed,sys] x 1 ;
 LDR W3,[X2] |                    | LDR W3,[X0] |                    ;
scopes: (sys (gpu (cta P1) (cta P3)))
exists (0:X1=1 /\ 0:X3=0 /\ 2:X1=1 /\ 2:X3=0)
